<!doctype html>
<html lang="ja">
<head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><meta name="theme-color" content="#101713"/><title>青の分岐点｜人生シミュレーション</title><meta name="description" content="生まれる時代も場所も、選ぶ道も。ひとつの人生を歩くシミュレーション。"/><link rel="canonical" href="https://knotspace.github.io/game/"/></head>
<body class="game-center-body">
<main class="game-home">
  <header class="game-hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">AO NO BUNKITEN</p>
    <h1>PLAY YOUR<br/><span>STORY.</span></h1>
    <p class="lead">生まれる場所も、家族も、自分では選べない。<br/>偶然と決断が重なっていく、一度きりの人生を体験しよう。</p>
    <div class="hero-meta"><span>GAMES & SIMULATIONS</span><span>YOUR CHOICE, YOUR STORY.</span></div>
  </header>
  <section class="game-section">
    <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">AVAILABLE NOW</p><h2>ゲーム一覧</h2></div><span>01 / 01</span></div>
    <a class="game-card" href="/game/life/">
      <div class="game-art"><span class="art-kicker">LIFE SIMULATION</span><strong>YOUR<br/>LIFE.</strong><span class="art-bottom">FROM CHILDHOOD TO THE FUTURE</span><i>↗</i></div>
      <div class="game-copy"><span class="game-status">PLAYABLE</span><h3>青の分岐点</h3><p>47都道府県のどこかに生まれ、家族や時代、出会いに囲まれながら一生を歩む。進学・仕事・人間関係の選択と、思いがけない出来事が人生を変えていく。</p><span class="play-link">ゲームを始める <b>→</b></span></div>
    </a>
    <div class="coming-card"><span>COMING NEXT</span><strong>NEW GAME</strong><p>新しいゲームを準備中。</p></div>
  </section>
  <footer class="game-foot"><span>AO NO BUNKITEN</span><span>MADE TO EXPLORE.</span><nav><a href="/">KNOT</a><a href="/study/">KNOT Study</a></nav></footer>
</main>
</body>
</html>
<style>
:root{color-scheme:dark;--text:#f2f6ee;--muted:#a3b09f;--line:#344238;--surface:#17231b;font-family:Inter,'Noto Sans JP',system-ui,sans-serif}*{box-sizing:border-box}body.game-center-body{margin:0;min-height:100vh;background:#0d130f;color:var(--text)}.game-home{--game-accent:#a6f36b;max-width:1080px;margin:0 auto;padding:42px 22px 30px;color:var(--text)}
.game-home a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
.game-hero{position:relative;min-height:390px;padding:48px 5.5% 28px;background:#101713;color:#f3f6ef;overflow:hidden}
.game-hero:after{content:"";position:absolute;width:360px;height:360px;right:7%;top:8%;border:1px solid rgba(166,243,107,.3);border-radius:50%;box-shadow:0 0 0 35px rgba(166,243,107,.035),0 0 0 75px rgba(166,243,107,.025)}
.eyebrow{font:10px ui-monospace,monospace;letter-spacing:.18em;color:#a6f36b;font-weight:800}
.game-hero h1{position:relative;z-index:1;margin:35px 0 18px;font:900 clamp(58px,10vw,112px)/.82 Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.09em}
.game-hero h1 span{color:#a6f36b}
.game-hero .lead{position:relative;z-index:1;color:#c4cec1;font-size:13px;line-height:2}
.hero-meta{position:relative;z-index:1;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;border-top:1px solid #344238;padding-top:13px;margin-top:36px;color:#8f9d8d;font:9px ui-monospace,monospace;letter-spacing:.12em}
.game-section{padding:38px 5.5%}
.section-heading{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end;margin-bottom:20px}.section-heading h2{font-size:25px;margin:7px 0 0}.section-heading>span{font:10px ui-monospace,monospace;color:var(--muted)}
.game-card{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.05fr .95fr;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--surface);transition:transform .25s,border-color .25s}.game-card:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);border-color:#a6f36b}
.game-art{position:relative;min-height:290px;padding:24px;background:#18251b;color:#f4f7ef;overflow:hidden;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between}
.game-art:before{content:"";position:absolute;width:230px;height:230px;border:1px solid rgba(166,243,107,.35);border-radius:50%;right:-30px;top:30px;box-shadow:0 0 0 25px rgba(166,243,107,.04),0 0 0 55px rgba(166,243,107,.03)}
.art-kicker,.art-bottom{position:relative;z-index:1;color:#a6f36b;font:9px ui-monospace,monospace;letter-spacing:.15em}.game-art strong{position:relative;z-index:1;font:900 clamp(55px,8vw,90px)/.8 Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1em}.game-art i{position:absolute;right:22px;bottom:20px;font-size:28px;color:#a6f36b;font-style:normal}
.game-copy{padding:30px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start}.game-status{padding:5px 8px;border:1px solid #a6f36b;color:#5d9b34;font:9px ui-monospace,monospace;letter-spacing:.1em}.game-copy h3{font-size:24px;margin:17px 0 9px}.game-copy p{font-size:12px;line-height:2;color:var(--muted);margin:0}.play-link{margin-top:auto;padding-top:25px;font-size:12px;font-weight:850}.play-link b{margin-left:15px;color:#78b746;font-size:18px}
.coming-card{margin-top:18px;padding:19px 22px;border:1px dashed var(--line);display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:5px 20px}.coming-card>span{font:9px ui-monospace,monospace;color:var(--muted);letter-spacing:.15em}.coming-card strong{text-align:right;font:11px ui-monospace,monospace}.coming-card p{grid-column:1/-1;margin:4px 0 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:11px}
.game-foot{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:18px 5.5%;border-top:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--muted);font:9px ui-monospace,monospace;letter-spacing:.12em}
@media(max-width:700px){.game-home{padding:15px 10px}.game-hero{min-height:350px;padding:35px 6% 20px}.game-hero:after{right:-100px;top:60px}.game-hero h1{font-size:clamp(62px,17vw,92px)}.game-section{padding:27px 2%}.game-card{grid-template-columns:1fr}.game-art{min-height:230px}.game-copy{padding:22px}.game-copy p{font-size:11px}.game-foot{font-size:8px}}
</style>